# Release 0.2.0

Version 0.2.0 adds a dry-run mode. It also starts faster.

## Upgrading

Run `example-tool upgrade`, then check the log:

```
$ example-tool --version
example-tool 0.2.0
```

dry-run

Prints the plan without running it.

Questions? Email the team or read the [FAQ](https://docs.example.com/faq).
